; C12B  Winning 42 p. 183 (W42-p183-c); the three-trump form is p. 32
; (W42-p032-a) and p. 183 (W42-p183-g), played in Hands 16 and 29
; (pp. 31, 101)
; Rule, in our words: on the first trick, a bidder with exactly four trumps,
; holding the top trump but neither the second- nor the third-highest, leads
; his lowest trump first and budgets the loss of that trick.
; Python gate (pour_bidder gate_c12, variant B): the same, four trumps only,
; under pip trumps.
; How this encoding differs: none from the gate under pip trumps. The ranks
; are relational, as in C12A, so the reading also applies under doubles trump.
; The book's worked examples of the rule hold three trumps (Hand 29, p. 101),
; where neither fires. The book allows the top trump first when a trump count
; tile is at stake (W42-p183-d); neither the gate nor this file has that
; exception.
(policy c12b-four-trumps-lead-low
  (initial play)
  (fallback lowest-legal)
  (rule lead-the-lowest-trump (in play) (next play) (select answer)
    (guard
      (query
        (roles (chair b) (domino top) (domino second) (domino third) (domino low) (domino t2) (domino t3))
        (out low)
        (pattern
          (viewer b)
          (declarer b)
          (trick-number 1)
          (next-actor b)
          (in top q*)
          (none (roles (domino above)) (in above q*) (beats above top q*))
          (in second q*)
          (beats top second q*)
          (none (roles (domino above)) (in above q*) (beats above second q*) (not (tile above top)))
          (in third q*)
          (beats second third q*)
          (none (roles (domino above)) (in above q*) (beats above third q*)
            (not (tile above top)) (not (tile above second)))
          (own-legal top)
          (not (own-legal second))
          (not (own-legal third))
          (own-legal low)
          (in low q*)
          (none (roles (domino below)) (own-legal below) (in below q*) (beats low below q*))
          (own-legal t2) (in t2 q*)
          (own-legal t3) (in t3 q*)
          (none (roles (domino fifth)) (own-legal fifth) (in fifth q*)
            (not (tile fifth top)) (not (tile fifth low)) (not (tile fifth t2)) (not (tile fifth t3))))))))
